Tuza06.FiveCoverage.classify : ∀ E ⊆ Tuza.edges Finset.univ,
  (∀ (a : Fin 5), 2 ≤ {b | {a, b} ∈ E}.card) →
    ∃ r p,
      Tuza06.liftFamily (Equiv.toEmbedding (Tuza06.FiveCoverage.permutation p)) E = Tuza06.FiveCoverage.representative r
'Tuza06.FiveCoverage.classify' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
